# secrets & local config / 密钥与本地配置
# .env* rather than .env: Notepad silently saves ".env" as ".env.txt", and a
# credential file that misses the ignore rule by three characters is a
# credential file in a public commit.
# 用 .env* 而不是 .env：记事本会把 ".env" 存成 ".env.txt"，差三个字符就等于
# 把密钥提交上去。
.env*
!.env.example
config.yaml

# runtime output / 运行时输出
logs/
control.cmd
*.log

# python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
